#: ../../source/base/audio35.rst:42
msgid ""
"Atomic Audio-3.5 Base uses the same Audio CODEC and pin connections as "
"Atomic Echo Base. For detailed usage instructions, please refer to the "
"`Atomic Echo Base <echo.html>`_ documentation."
